# Toolchain

Use [contributing instructions](../../CONTRIBUTING.md). Node 24.14+ runs the reader; CI exercises Node 24 and 26. Saved-HTML preparation is tested with Python 3.12 and uv.

Use the root npm lockfile. The HTML script's inline dependency declaration is its input manifest; its generated requirements lock is the test/audit environment. Root Python TOML contains lint configuration.

Use isolated environments for Python dependency checks. Local file, trial-preflight and MCP tests require no model credentials or inference calls.
